        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.355,
            0.582,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Express the number 143 in this new system."
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.379,
            0.847,
            0.418
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us start grouping, starting with the size "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 ^ { 3 }   =   1 2 5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , as this is the largest landmark number smaller than 143. We get—"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.348,
            0.422,
            0.649,
            0.44
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_15_equation_19.jpg",
          "content": "143 = 125 + 5 + 5 + 5 + 1 + 1 + 1."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.445,
            0.76,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So the number 143 in the new system is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\textcircled{O}  \\square \\square \\square \\square \\triangle \\triangle \\triangle \\cdot"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.471,
            0.712,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Number systems having landmark numbers in which the"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.496,
            0.57,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) first landmark number is 1, and"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.52,
            0.847,
            0.576
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) every next landmark number is obtained by multiplying the current landmark number by some fixed number n is said to be a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "base-n",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " number system."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.576,
            0.848,
            0.633
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The Egyptian number system is a base-10 system, and the number system that we created is a base-5 system. A base-10 number system is also called a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "decimal number system.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.642,
            0.293,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.667,
            0.847,
            0.706
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Write the following numbers in the above base-5 system using the symbols in Table 2: 15, 50, 137, 293, 651."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.716,
            0.847,
            0.754
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Is there a number that cannot be represented in our base-5 system above? Why or why not?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.764,
            0.848,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Compute the landmark numbers of a base-7 system. In general, what are the landmark numbers of a base-n system?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 29,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.806,
            0.848,
            0.845
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The landmark numbers of a base-n number system are the powers of n starting from "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { 0 } = 1 , n , n ^ { 2 } , n ^ { 3 } ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 30,
          "bbox": [
            0.877,
            0.915,
            0.913,
            0.936
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "63"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
